{
  "id": "ACT.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Tim Pa Jomoor 10",
  "verseCount": 48,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Petero kodi Kornelio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onwaŋo nitie dhano i Kasareya m'ilwoŋo ni Kornelio, jasirikale madwoŋ i lwak jolweny ma Roma m'ilwoŋo ni kitipa pa Joitalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oyido obedo jadin matek gi ot pere gibe aka jolworo Were. Go oyido miyo kony madit ri jocandi, aka onwaŋo kwayo Were noknok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dho kapa sawa abuŋwen odieceŋ moro, go oneno cal m'omenyere rigo, m'onen'iye malaika pa Were munyo donjo to lwoŋo go ni, “Kornelio!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go omoro waŋe kwoŋ malaika gi lworo aka owaco ni, “Aŋo jadwoŋ?” Ana malaika: “Were ojolo kwayo perin gi tic perin ma konyo ji, aka onyo opoyin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo or jomoro i Yopa jowolwoŋ Simon ma nyinge man Petero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go obedo wendo pa Simon ma jajwayi piendere ma bedo dho thengi wakawaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo malaika m'onwaŋo luwo gine okadho, aka Kornelio olwoŋo jotic ma ot pere jario kodi jasirikale, ma bende jadin matek m'onwaŋo obedo acel kwoŋ jokur pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owaco rijo gim'otimere je to oro jo Yopa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere mere kapa sawa aucel m'odieceŋ, munyo jonitie i woth pajo aka onwaŋo joriko Yopa, Petero oidho wi ot kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo go ocako winjo kec to mito gir'acama; aka munyo fodi itedo cemo, ocako nur to neno cal m'omenyere rigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oneno polo oyawere aka gimoro oloro m'ocalo suka malac m'ocar piny gi sonda mere aŋwen pa kidho umo piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I suka no onwaŋo nitie le ma piny ma kite je, gigipiny ma mol gi kor gin piny kodi winyin ma malo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwondi jo moro owaco rigo ni; “Ay malo, Petero, ineki icami!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Petero owaco ni, “K'ameno, Rwoth! Fodi yado akicamo gimoro je m'itero paka gima kicar, kosa ma k'olony.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwondi jo no odoko oluwo gine ni, “Gima Were otieko lonyo, ikir'ilwoŋo ni gima kicar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gime otimere didek to idwoko gino i polo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Petero fodi uro dwoŋ cal ma go oneno no, ji ma Kornelio ooro rango kama ot pa Simon nitie iye jotundo kenyo to jocungo dho waŋkac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolwoŋo gi dwondi jo ma malo to jopenjo ni, “Nitie wendo moro ka ma nyinge Simon Petero?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero oyido fodi temo niaŋ i dwoŋ cal ma go oneno no to Cuny Maleŋ waco rigo ni, “Kole nitie ji adek ka ma jorangin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo yikere ilor, aka ikir'imindaminda m'ikikadho gi jo, rupiri aŋat'aoro jo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Petero oloro to waco rijo ni, “An a ŋata wirango. Wibino raŋo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowaco ni, “Jasirikale madwoŋ m'ilwoŋo ni Kornelio ama ooro wan. Go obedo ŋataber ma lamo Were aka Joyuda joworo go swa. Acel kwoŋ jomalaika pa Were owaco rigo nike wolwoŋin i ot pere, wonyali winjo gim'inowaci.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero orwako jono i ot to jonindo kenyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere mere go oyikere to kadho gi jo; aka jowote moro ma jowok Yopa bende jokadho gine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere mere jotundo Kasareya kama Kornelio oyido kur'iye go, kanyacel gi wade pere gi merin pere ma go olwoŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Petero nyaka donjo i ot, Kornelio oromo gine, to podho dho tiende gi bwonirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero owaco rigo woay malo. Owaco ni, “cuny, kole abende adhano adhana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero omedere gi luwo kodi Kornelio munyo donjo i ot, kam'onwaŋ'iye ji mathoth ma jocokere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owaco rijo ni, “Wiwegi wiŋeyo maber nike dini pa Jayuda kiyey go riwirok kodi Jopath. To Were otieko nyuthan ni akir'ater dhano moro je paka jakicar kosa ni k'olony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo munyo ioro ji lwoŋan abino m'ongoye piem. Onyo wac ran gim'omiyo ilwoŋan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kornelio owaco ni, “Ndelo aŋwen m'okadho onwaŋo akwayo i ot paran sawa abuŋwen m'odieceŋ. Piyo piyo dhano m'orukere i ruk ma minyin ocungo ruwaŋan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owaco ni, ‘Kornelio! Were owinjo kwayo perin, aka opoyo tic perin ma konyo ji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or dhano moro Yopa wolwoŋi jal m'ilwoŋo ni Simon Petero ma obedo wendo peco pa Simon jajwayi piendere, ma bedo dho thengi wakawaka!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo aoro ji lwoŋin mayot, aka itimo maber bino. Pama onyo wajoje wan ka i nyim Were, wakuro winjo gimoro je ma Rwoth oorin waco.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mikwenda pa Petero",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 10:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero ocako luwo ni, “Onyo pama aneno adieri ni Were tero dhano je marom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyatoro je ma lworo go aka timo gim'otire, go jolo m'ongoye tito nono pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiŋeyo fonji ma go odhiro ri ji ma Isiraili, ma tito Wac Manyen Maber ma kelo siem i Yesu Kristo, m'obedo Rwoth pa ji je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiŋeyo gimadwoŋ m'otimere i Yuda parom, cako Galili, cako kwoŋ batisimo ma Yohana ofonjo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka Were okonjo kwoŋ Yesu ma Nazareth Cuny Maleŋ kodi meni; paka go okidho kamoro je munyo timo bero gi botho joma two je m'onwaŋo jonitie i acanda pa jwogi, rupiri Were oyido nigi go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabedo jokony ma joŋeyo gimoro je ma go otimo i piny Yuda kodi i Yerusalem. Joneko go munyo joguro go kwoŋ musalaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Were ocerino go kwoŋ jom'otho i ndelo mar'adek, to miyo go menyere ri ji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji je jok'oneno go, to wan ayino ma wabedo jokony ma Were otieko yero. Wacemo odoko waoro gir'amadha kanyacel gine munyo Were otieko cerino go kwoŋ jom'otho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka go ooro wan fonjo ji Wac Manyen Maber, gi nyutho jo kamaler nike go a ŋata Were oketho thumo banja pa jomakwo gi jom'otho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotuci wac Were je joluwo kwoŋe, munyo jowaco ni nyatoro je m'oyey go ibino cwako reco pere gi meni ma nyingi go.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jopath jolimo Cuny Maleŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Petero fodi luwo, Cuny Maleŋ oloro kwoŋ joje m'onwaŋo jociko ithi jo jowinjo fonji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyuda ma joyeyo ma jobino wok Yopa gi Petero jodhier ni Were okonjo mic pere ma Cuny Maleŋ kwoŋ Jopath bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato jowinjo munyo joluwo i dhodhok manyen manyakare ka jopako dwoŋ pa Were. Aka Petero owaco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nitie ŋata nyalo geŋo jome kwoŋ batisimo ma pi ma to bende jotieko limo Cuny Maleŋ paka wan?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo go ooro jo ni wobatisa jo i nyingi Yesu Kristo. Rumacen jokwayo Petero gin ni jowobed'iye gi jo ndelo ma romo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
